+# Axolot Client 0.16.2 – Mods UI Preview
+
+- New Minecraft-themed Mods Workshop based on the approved visual design.
+- Real per-profile installed files, enable/disable, import and remove actions.
+- Discover search integrated with existing Modrinth / CurseForge backend.
+- Compatibility Doctor reports real checks; no invented health status.
+- Native resource/shader pack ZIP import and removal.
+- Actual installed versions displayed from JAR filenames; no misleading fabricated metadata.
+- No auto-update stable changes.
